  "id": "baked-halibut-steaks",
  "name": "Baked Halibut Steaks",
  "subtitle": "Halibut with tomatoes, zucchini, basil, and feta",
  "description": "Halibut bakes over a savory vegetable mixture until opaque and flaky, with fresh basil and feta for a bright finish.",
